{"id":"ccbc13-14:ccbc-14-32","answer":"SODIUM CARBONATE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"完全不知道这题要找什么","html":"<p>这题需要根据民居邮票系列找到每个民居对应的面值。</p>","text":"这题需要根据民居邮票系列找到每个民居对应的面值。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"最后提取要注意什么","html":"<p>把黑色和白色信封分开来可以得到一个单词，然后按照【黑+白】的顺序提交。</p>","text":"把黑色和白色信封分开来可以得到一个单词，然后按照【黑+白】的顺序提交。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据邮票和图案里的各地中国民居，不难想到/搜到中国的《民居》邮票系列。找到题目里各个民居来自什么省份，根据《民居》计算每个信封上的面值总和，通过 A1Z26 转换英文字母。黑白信封可以分别得到 <code>SODIUM CARBONATE</code>，即本题答案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图</th>\n<th>对应邮票</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-b82e0660c8fea936afdbab59\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/96346852095b49a68061404c143131a1.webp\"/></td>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-ad8687fd47a61e85a95eb76b\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/221fa1b37ead4d21bbb79ecfb493626b.webp\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-68d1cd1c0c7cd0a5a400335d\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/eef73c4e04474ad1982c01e87d443fa6.webp\"/></td>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-e23b43b570f2f9521412934b\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/e1f2d39543974a488259ce60dd8d2087.webp\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-b38e7eebefdb476d6b9654dd\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/33f914bf5d1b4d52bc114e0430567c8d.webp\"/></td>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-bdf9a845edf0197aa257a5d8\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/5911ce396dd240ef83ed46c39bb170ea.webp\"/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-9b6bf860f62c6cb92f6bd939\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/762e8fbe9519401ebcc87b430d75a48d.webp\"/></td>\n<td><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"asset-57d8b1b222abec